  "title": "IRADIMED CORPORATION Announces Uplisting to The Nasdaq Global MarketTrading to commence effective on the market open June 14, 2024",
  "summary": "Iradimed announced today its common stock will uplist and commence trading on the Nasdaq Global Market, effective June 14, 2024, and will continue under the ticker symbol “IRMD.” Stockholders are not required to take any action due to the uplisting.",
